(text "Module pad 21 ANT: NC, use module IPEX. Both pads 9 and 10 are VCC. H1 is the mandatory alignment-post hole.\nDIO2 is AUX0 for a local test point only; do not connect it to a Pico GPIO.\nAUX1 is reserved. DIO3 is internal TCXO control, configured to 2.2 V." (at 140 100 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "161f763e-bb89-5039-aa6e-869ae53ed663"))
